  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training of Trainers and training materials young dairy processors Nakuru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the development of a business incubation programme for young dairy processors and dairy students making the processing professional and running the farm as a business after graduation in Nakuru county. The focus is the training of Kenyan trainers on business incubation (technical, managerial and entrepreneurial aspects inclusive guiding and coaching the students in developing their business plan). And the contextualizing of the Dutch and Kenyan existing materials, 10 modules on dairy processing techniques and economics.Partners are the Dairy Training Centre Partners BV and Rift Valley Institute of Science and Technology.</narrative>
  </description>
